==============================================================================
PART 2 - gesture classification

Stage 1: 1 press to identify the button electrically (edge opposite USB-C).
Stage 2: 10 short taps  -> short=11 cumulative
Stage 3: 10 long holds  -> long=10
Stage 4: 6 very-long holds + 1 stray tap -> very_long=6, short=12

raw_edges advances by exactly 2 per press throughout: no contact bounce was
captured on this switch. events advances by exactly 1 per press, which is what
proves VeryLongPress is not also emitted on release.
